From: gentoo-zh overlay
Subject: [PATCH] sched: restore alternative scheduler Kconfig preimage

Linux 7.2.6 added GENERIC_ALLOCATOR to SCHED_CLASS_EXT. PRJC and MuQSS
replace the scheduler core and disable SCHED_CLASS_EXT, but their patch
preimage predates that select. Remove it before applying either scheduler
patch so the upstream dependency hunk applies without changing the normal
scheduler configuration.

--- a/kernel/Kconfig.preempt
+++ b/kernel/Kconfig.preempt
@@ -171 +171,0 @@ config SCHED_CLASS_EXT
-	select GENERIC_ALLOCATOR
